<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST5796"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Ryddik<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Ryddik<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Wednesday, February 02, 2005 - 2:13 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->I belive when btk is caught he will fit the following <BR>- white male 55-65 years of age <BR> <BR>- lived in the area his whole life  <BR> <BR>- traveled for work until retirement <BR> <BR>- took college courses in engineering,art and photography <BR> <BR>- has an above average intellect in the 115-125 range <BR> <BR>- married in early 80&#39;s hence the stopping of letters to wpd <BR> <BR>- held a position of leadership in both business&#40;manager of some sort&#41; and home life &#40;a yes sir no sir type of father&#41; <BR> <BR>- verbally if not physically abusive in home life <BR>but is even tempered and seen as a problem solver <BR> <BR>- has been diagnosed with cancer within the last 5 years reacently it has moved to his bones and he has under a year left <BR> <BR> <BR> <BR><!--/Text--></td></tr>
