<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST5824"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Audreyamw<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Audreyamw<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->1-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Wednesday, February 02, 2005 - 4:53 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->I have something else to add:  Shirley Vian&#39;s kids and Kevin Bright both made the observation that BTK had a pot belly. I doubt that he&#39;s started working out at the gym since then, so I&#39;d say he still has a pot belly. <BR> <BR>I&#39;m also guessing that the Pot-Bellied Pig of Wichita consumes too much sugar in his diet.  I wonder if he&#39;s diabetic?<!--/Text--></td></tr>
