<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST5828"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Crimone<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Crimone<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->1-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Wednesday, February 02, 2005 - 5:12 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->How frustrating it must be to BTK as he reads these profiles and theories as they are so far off. It is more like this:  <BR> <BR>White Male  <BR>54--&#40;soon to be 55&#41;  <BR>Was a student at WSU &#40;Degree in the helping field&#41;  <BR>Also worked as an intern at one of the local schools  <BR>Married a lady who had a small son and raised him until the age of 19  <BR>Then married another lady who had a small girl--she became Daddy&#39;s little girl and the Father-Daughter bond was never been stronger <BR>Was a great Father and Husband  <BR>Had no children of his own because he did not have sexual intimacy with either wives.  <BR>Not an only child, but raised as one due to siblings being much older than him. <BR>Mother was &#40;still is&#41; very dear to him--it pains him to see her slowly dying. <BR>Raised in the Seventh Day Adventist congregation.  <BR>Has worked &#40;and continues to work&#41; in the helping field--and has had a great career of helping others.  <BR>Those around him would say, &#34;He&#39;s the kindest, most caring person we know.&#34;  <BR>Inspired by Einstein--and he and I both know why.  <BR>Has an aversion to the number 12--also numbers that add up to 12.  <BR>Has only one thing in common with Dr. Mould--he  and I both know what that is.  <BR>He never wanted to harm or kill anyone--still does not want to. <BR>Has an inner librarian who reminds him regularly that he can check himself out at any time. <BR>Favorite cereals are Corn Flakes and Cheerios <BR>The ceral box is reference to a joke/saying---&#34;Yeah I am a real cereal killer, I killed the whole box.&#34;  <BR>Remember, it is not him--it is the Monster<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 5828-->
<!--Post: 5860--><!--Time: 1107409958-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST5860"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Moondog<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Moondog<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Wednesday, February 02, 2005 - 9:52 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->In my humble opinion BTK: <BR>- is a Caucasian in his mid-50&#39;s &#40;basing this on the 911 recording&#41; <BR>- works or worked in a service industry &#40;phoneline repairman, copier repairman, maybe a mailman&#41; where he could use his mind/hands to troubleshoot &amp; solve problems.  This type of work may bore him terribly but could occasionally offer a challenge &#40;he obviously likes puzzles&#41; <BR>- has millitary experience <BR>- has above average intelligence <BR>- may have attended WSU on a GI bill <BR>- has recently retired or divorced <BR>- may have married or dated a single mother in the late 70&#39;s <BR>- was/is not an engineer at Boeing &#40;I&#39;ve worked with a lot of engineers and not a single one of them liked to read/write poetry - I&#39;m stereotyping here and opining that engineers are strictly left-brained&#41; <BR>- has an obvious stocking/foot fetish and interest in BDSM &#40;perhaps BTK stumbled upon some BDSM videos or magazines while working as a mailman or was introduced or exposed to BDSM while stationed in San Francisco during his millitary service.  BTK has been linked in many ways to the Zodiac Killer so I&#39;m guessing BTK spent time in the SF area&#41; <BR> <BR>  Most of us aren&#39;t privy to much of the evidence so again these are just guesses on my part and could be way off.  The contradictions are numerous and complicated, but I feel anyone who has played this game on and off for 30&#43; years and avoided capture is more than just lucky.   <BR> <BR>  Many of the posters on this site have jumped to the conclusion BTK is stupid based solely on the poor grammar and spelling in his communications.  I don&#39;t think these errors were calculated or made purposely to throw off LE, but poor grammar and spelling don&#39;t make BTK stupid.  I think BTK struggles with being both left brained &#40;meticulous, calculating, logical&#41; and right brained &#40;artistic, feeling&#41;.  He may have been disintersted in school and done poorly in English as a result which could explain his lack of skill in this area.  I know a graphic artist whose spelling/grammar are deplorable and downright embarassing, yet he is very keen in other ways - computer programs, math, and word puzzles.   <BR> <BR>  The gaps in BTK&#39;s known activity &#40;&#39;77-&#39;86 &amp; &#39;86-&#39;04&#41; are difficult to explain.  There are many suggestions out there including imprisonment, job relocation, marriage, illness - who knows.  I find imprisonment to be very unlikely because a man who can murder at least 8 people, taunt the police, and get away with it strikes me as being too clever to get caught stealing cars or peeping in windows.  Besides, being convicted of such an offense would have placed him in the suspect pool.  Job relocation is possible, but given my opinion that BTK worked in a service related field such as those listed above probably wouldn&#39;t have afforded him many opportunities to relocate.  BTK seemed to feel very comfortable in the Wichita area so why would he move?  If he did relocate I suspect he would have continued killing, and given his desire for attention would have likely taunted his new community.  Marriage seems the most likely explanation to me.  My guess would be BTK married a meek woman, possibly a single mother.  I doubt he fathered a child of his own due to his apparent sexual hang-ups, but maybe being a husband and step father was the first good thing to happen in his life so he was able to focus on the positive and surpress the evil urges.  Vicki Wegerle may have been a terrible lapse?  If this is the case, are there more victims BTK is &#39;hiding&#39; - very likely. <BR>   <BR>The resurfacing of BTK after all of these years is troubling.  Was he recently released from prison, did his mother or spouse pass away, did his child or step-child leave for college, was he diagnosed with a terminal illness?  Who knows, but I suspect feel his situation changed &#40;divorce, loss of loved one, or retirement&#41; and he has much more free time on his hands.  The sexual urges have eroded with time but the desire to dominate and manipulate others still exists, which is why BTK resumed taunting the police and terrorizing Wichita.  I can offer no reasonable explanation for BTK parting with prized trophies he&#39;s hidden for so long.  Maybe the public shock value of giving them up and intensifying his control fixation became greater than his waning sexual urges.  Maybe they&#39;re the only cards he has left to drag out this game with LE and the media and re-focus the attention on himself. <BR>  Feel free to correct me - it&#39;s late and I&#39;m full of it <IMG SRC="http://www.catchbtk.com/discus/clipart/happy.gif" ALT=":-&#41;" BORDER=0> <BR>   <BR><!--/Text--></td></tr>
