<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST6019"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Hbtcontrol<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Hbtcontrol<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->1-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Thursday, February 03, 2005 - 5:35 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->I rather like this idea of posting our own, weak as they may be, profiles.  I would prefer that they not be bashed here by anyone since I think we&#39;d all just like to see this guy &#40;and I say that with great reservation because I can&#39;t find anything human about him&#41; caught. <BR> <BR>So here is my two cents - probably worth even less. But when he is caught &#40;and yes he will be&#41; then we&#39;ll see how we did with the meager information we had. <BR> <BR>He is a baby boomer, possibly born in 1949-50. <BR> <BR>Has a least one sister, younger than he is. <BR> <BR>Attended WSU, but may not have graduated. <BR> <BR>Has never had a real friendship. <BR> <BR>His &#34;interest&#34; in hunting, camping and fishing was limited to his victims. <BR> <BR>Military experience was probably ROTC or National Guard. May have drawn a high draft number. <BR> <BR>Short lived interest in poetry, folk stories, and writing - but probably not long after the late seventies. Possibily related to a failed romantic interest at the time. <BR> <BR>Frequented &#39;adult&#39; book stores in the seventies and eighties. And possible still does along with internet sites. <BR> <BR>Early school teachers would have noted problems or just a sense of things not &#39;right&#39; with him that were probably dismissed. Above average intelligence but excelled only in areas that provided great interest to him. <BR> <BR>He may have applied for and been rejected as a police officer. <BR> <BR>He stalked his known victims but also took advantage of opportunities that may result in additional victims to be still attributed to him. <BR> <BR>He frequents prostitutes, but probably never the same ones since his need to strangle them to near death probably precludes a second visit. <BR> <BR>He works or worked in an office, probably in a math or engineering capacity. <BR>   <BR>Moved away from the immediate area of the killings after college. <BR> <BR>Married and divorced.  <BR> <BR>Interest in photography is limited to b/d, pornography and kill photos. <BR> <BR>Probably a &#39;petty&#39; thief in early years, stealing whatever he liked from family, friends, neighbors.  <BR> <BR>Opinionated and dominating to the point of being obnoxious and disliked. <BR> <BR>Has intense hatred of women. He may be &#39;killing&#39; his mother or grandmother and sister with each victim.  <BR> <BR>Mother/sister/grandmother/wife were probably recipients of some of the trophies he took from victims, especially jewelry.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
