<!--Post: 6335--><!--Time: 1107704870-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST6335"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Scbenson2001<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Scbenson2001<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->6-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Sunday, February 06, 2005 - 7:47 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->BTK  <BR> <BR>White Male 58 to 65 years old <BR>Single-Never Married <BR>No children <BR>Parents dead maybe older siblings but no contact for many years <BR>Loner&#40;who tried in younger years to join many diffrent types of groups but was ostracized&#41;. <BR>Voyeur by nature loves to people watch <BR>Likes to work outdoors <BR>Occupation would be menial <BR>Co-workers and people in contact with BTK on daily basis would consider him slow. <BR>Would have severe problems working with people so job mostly involves himself alone <BR>Would have had in past trouble with female coworkers <BR>BTK detests physical contact <BR>Considers sex beneath him <BR>Sexually aroused by bondage and S&amp;M <BR>Not as stupid as would appear but not very smart  <BR>Would read alot newspapers especially <BR>Frequents libraries, bookstores and parks anywhere where loitering is common and accepted <BR>Considers himself brilliant but knows nobody else does <BR>Very neat <BR>Has facial disfigurement may just be large mole or birthmark <BR> <BR>Stopped killing after fox murder because LE got close to him <BR> <BR>At one time potential suspect but was wrongly cleared <BR> <BR>Did resume killing but stopped communication with police <BR> <BR>Will reveal more murders <BR>Besides taking pictures at crime scenes also recorded some. <BR>Lives inside a world of fantasy <BR>NEVER WOULD MOVE FAR FROM WICHITA it means to much to him. <BR>Currently facing life threatening illness possibley prostate cancer. <BR>Shirley Vian murder last minute substition for another planned victim. <BR>Nancy Fox was well planned and BTK knew her. Because of this he was questioned by police after her murder. <BR>He tried to mislead police by claiming both Vian and Fox where not pre-planned. Only Vian was not pre-planned.  <BR> <BR> <BR><!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 6335-->
<!--Post: 6507--><!--Time: 1107840182-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST6507"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Tecno242<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Tecno242<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Monday, February 07, 2005 - 9:23 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->I don&#39;t think he was ever married.  He&#39;s likely to self absorbed to desire a family or attempt to create a &#34;normal&#34; life for himself.  He probably failed, at an early age, on any attempts of a normal relationship.  He would be very controlling in his personal life and would not respond well to rejection.  One rejection of his control was probably enough for him to form a very negative opinion of women and send him deeper into his fantasy world of sexual gratification. <BR> <BR>I do not believe any one event in his life triggered &#34;the monster&#34; to reveal itself.  It could have occured slowly over time, building to the obsession it has become.  If any one event did trigger it, I believe it could have been his fathers death. <BR> <BR>He is certainly internet savy. He probably uses it frequently to satisfy his needs without actually killing.  He knows killing is wrong and he would like to stop, but he does enjoy it.  It&#39;s not the actual act of killing however, but the intense feeling of power over his victims that he craves.  I think this is displayed most in his practice of bringing his victims to the brink of death only to bring them back and repeat.   <BR> <BR>I don&#39;t believe his mother was present as a child.  She either left them or was dead.  His father may have been in the military and exerted a great deal of control over him.  His father may have beat him, but more likely verbally abused him to the point of making him feel worthless and unloved.  If he has siblings, and I don&#39;t believe so, he no longer has any connection with them.  A personality such as his, unable to identify with anyone and completely self absorbed, I think must be created as an only child.  A child with siblings learns early to share and love someone other than themselves or thier parents. <BR> <BR>His father probably died years ago, possibly before the murders began.  Like Michael Jackson, he was probably left with no authority figure to guide him or correct him.  This would also explain why he is so difficult to find, he has no surving relatives of any kind and probably no friends that truly know him.  I would compare his situation to Ed Gein. <BR> <BR>The difference however would be that BTK is quite intelligent and can function normally when in public. <BR> <BR>I believe he has worked the same job for quite some time but was not particulary successful nor a failure.  He probably works a job with little social interaction and not much chance for advancment.  He would be content sliding by.  My guesses for occupations include a security gaurd, data entry position &#40;possibly at the Kansas DMV&#41;, or a local contractor doing odd jobs.  Any of these would allow him to hand pick victims and could provide him with addresses. <BR> <BR>I&#39;d like to add that these are just my personal opinions, so they don&#39;t mean much.   But i would still like to share them. <BR> <BR><!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 6507-->
<!--Post: 6810--><!--Time: 1108016369-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST6810"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Foxfire<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Foxfire<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Wednesday, February 09, 2005 - 10:19 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Here&#39;s my imagined profile of him: <BR> <BR>I think he is probably 60 to 64 years of age. <BR>I think he may simply have 1/4th or even 1/8th Native American blood which gives him the facial features but not necessarily the coloring. <BR>I think he is currently living alone in a frame house. <BR>He had a long time live-in girlfriend with at least one child, probably a boy, who BTK sort of felt sorry for as it reminded him of himself when he was kid. <BR>The boy grew up and moved out, and then the girlfriend moved out as well eventually because of BTK&#39;s lack of emotional intimacy. <BR>I think he&#39;s not sick so much as feeling his mortality or just &#34;feeling old&#34;. <BR>I don&#39;t believe he was really in law enforcement. Instead I think he picked up a lot of terms and mannerisms from the railroad detective his mother dated as well as railroad personnel. <BR>I don&#39;t think he drinks much if any, any more, if he ever did, but he may still smoke. <BR>He wears both jeans and khaki&#39;s a lot. <BR>He has one medium sized dog that he takes for walks sometimes, but he&#39;s really just using the dog to appear &#34;normal&#34; as he sort of cases places &#34;just in case&#34; he thinks he can ever gain control of another person. <BR>He may drive a P/U truck that is gray or silver. <BR>I think he carries a knife for protection of some sort, but that like somebody else said probably carries a gun when he makes his drops. <BR>I think he becomes really nervous and excited when he makes the drops and that&#39;s it&#39;s a substitute for what he can no longer do -- more than just &#34;for fun&#34; to taunt the police. <BR> <BR>I&#39;ve been having some weird dreams about him as well: <BR> <BR>One time I saw 4 shadowy towers with large birds flying up towards them as if I was seeing through his eyes. The sky was very overcast.  I didn&#39;t know what this meant &#40;if anything&#41;, but I did take the time to look up &#34;four towers and Wichita&#34;.  I came up with the new bridges at West Douglas and Lewis Streets.  I had no idea they existed until then as I don&#39;t live in the state of Kansas and I&#39;ve never been there in my life!  So I&#39;m wondering if he actually lives close to the river &#40;maybe the other side&#41; or if he walks on the riverwalk or the nearby park sometimes. <BR> <BR>Then a few nights later on, I dreamt that he was asking a female victim, &#34;Do you go to church?&#34;  I hear her saying, &#34;Yes.&#34;  He replies, &#34;Good.  Then you know where you&#39;re going after I&#39;m done with you.&#34; <BR> <BR>It&#39;s really, really chilling to me as I really have had true dreams before in the past and told family members or friends, and they have turned out to be true. <BR> <BR> <BR> <BR> <BR><!--/Text--></td></tr>
